---

The game mechanics implemented here (attribute thresholds, the three illness
chains, the nine school subjects, job and item ideas) were derived from a
reverse-engineering effort of QQ 宠物 (怀旧服 v1.2.4) published at
https://github.com/xuemian168/qqpet_automation. Only numeric values, subject
and illness *names* were reused; no original code or artwork is included in
this package. The two sprite SVGs under assets/ are original vector redraws
supplied by the project author. QQ 宠物 is a trademark of Tencent; this project
is independent and unaffiliated, and is not authorised by Tencent.
